        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>24\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 24\" stainless steel door handles feature an easy to grip 1-3/16\" square pull handle that is very comfortable.   For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. Warm <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Square Stainless Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Center to Center:  14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-3/16\" (31 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional  Surface mounted (Screws to the door face) or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
