                "title": "24 Inch Door Handles, Satin Stainless Steel",
                "description": "These 24 inch stainless steel door handle feature an easy to grip 1-3/16 inch square pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
